id:                     E3225
trigger_tool: configure|make|conan
phase: building|testing
error_signature: configure: error: missing required tool: flex|configure: error: missing required tool: help2man|configure: error: Required tool not found: libtool|configure: error: Required tool not found: GNU bash >= 4.0|/bin/bison: inaccessible or not found|m4sugar\.m4: cannot open|C compiler cannot create executables
severity:               3
category:               ohos, build-system, autotools, testing
match_keywords: autotools_configure, configure_failed, hmbs_repair_method, bison_pkgdatadir, vendor_bootstrap
title: Autotools强制工具缺失时运行时探针钉选与vendor自举三通道接线通用范式
root_cause: profile预设CC与CONFIG_SHELL在沙箱不可见且tool_requires只装包不进自定义configure PATH，叠加flex包无bin与bison硬编码与重定位数据目录丢失与ncurses缺头与多PATH前缀覆盖丢失垫片，使configure逐项报强制工具缺失
affected_scope: configure强制要求flex加bison加m4加bash加libtool加help2man与curses-panel-menu链接探测且真机无系统级工具的Autotools类C库
verification_cmd: 真机config.log见编译器段全过后失败点逐轮后移，探针HMBS_DIAG报胜出者真实执行通过且LIBS与BISON_PKGDATADIR随摘要保留，消费者烟囱4过4且腐烂套件转证据口径上报真实计数
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: runtime-probe-pin-plus-vendor-bootstrap-tri-channel
rec_description: 按conf到环境到PATH到已知路径到SDK顺序三重验证钉选CC并内联覆盖CONFIG_SHELL，对每项强制工具做tool包优先到设备候选的真实执行探针，胜出者经进程环境加conanbuild.sh加configure内联前缀三通道预设，无胜出者用官方源码vendor到私有prefix并以冒烟验收后钉选
rec_command: conanfile.py generate显式前置bindir并定义FLEX加BISON加YACC加M4加BASH加PKG_CONFIG加BISON_PKGDATADIR；build加真实探针并三通道钉选；缺失时vendor构建flex加help2man加libtool与补齐panel头并加文档熔断
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: evidence-only-bitrot-report
fallback_description: 若失败符号被上游tag证实为腐烂套件且CI从不运行，保留8用例全跑与gaps举证并转证据口径，消费者烟囱仍为阻塞门
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: /bin/bison
forbid_1_reason: 禁止复用bison包自带硬编码该路径的yacc包装器，真机无此路径必致make阶段失败
forbid_1_consequence: kconfig在parser.tab.c报找不到bison，构建退回make失败
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-crosstool-1.28.0-runtime-probe-vendor-bootstrap-tri-channel.md
last_updated: 2026-10-13
source_event: crosstool-1.28.0真机预检7种强制工具跨轮复现同构探针加三通道加vendor兜底并全部门禁通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 14002
